name setspaceenhanced
category Package
revision 68493
shortdesc An enhancement of the setspace package
relocated 1
longdesc This package adds support for all font sizes, even non-integer
longdesc resp. non-pt sizes to package setspace. This not only improves
longdesc compatibility with KOMA-Script but also corrects the stretch
longdesc value of the usual font sizes.
runfiles size=2
